00:27:18,384 --> 00:27:22,664
何連呼？忘れる？夢流した便所 見下ろしてきがかる摩天楼
Chanting what? Forgetting? Look down at the skyscraper over the toilet where dreams washed away!

308
00:27:23,334 --> 00:27:27,894
Oh まるで勝新みたいで破天荒 伝説へとアテンド
Oh, outrageous like Katsushinki, attending to legend.

309
00:27:28,074 --> 00:27:29,954
怖にゃあ怖にゃあてその程度
"Scared, scared"? That's about it.

310
00:27:30,114 --> 00:27:32,504
捨てろ負け惜しみ 過去の栄光
Throw away excuses and past glory!

311
00:27:32,654 --> 00:27:36,414
永遠なんざねぇて いつか天へ召される天で
There's no such thing as forever; someday we'll be called to heaven.

