なぁ 何か忘れちゃねぇか 人生まるで映画 皆がエンターテイナー
Hey, haven't you forgotten something? Life is like a movie, everyone's an entertainer.

314
00:27:46,314 --> 00:27:50,694
思い出せ思想は現実化する 誰かがHighway 飛ばすBentayga
Remember, thoughts become reality—someone speeds on the highway in a Bentayga.

315
00:27:51,474 --> 00:27:55,374
胸の奥底 初期衝動
