見て見ぬフリ No, No
Turning a blind eye? No, no.

317
00:28:00,774 --> 00:28:05,204
夢追い 笑われ 傷だらけでギラつく My way
Chasing dreams, being laughed at, glittering with scars—my way!

318
00:28:05,314 --> 00:28:10,014
Go on! You should know who we are forever young

319
