322
00:28:28,904 --> 00:28:31,884
半端な覚悟ならドブに捨てな (永遠)
If your resolve is half-hearted, throw it in the gutter! (Forever)

323
00:28:32,584 --> 00:28:36,534
往生際が悪いテメェ笑い飛ばし 誇れBetter days
Laugh off your poor grace, and be proud of better days.

324
