どんなムードこれ？あ、え？
What kind of mood is this? Ah, eh?

433
00:32:54,678 --> 00:32:55,848
あ、みんな、あ、あ、そして
Ah, everyone, ah, and then...

434
00:32:56,318 --> 00:32:58,608
みんな、次の曲で、えーっと...
everyone, for the next song, um...

435
00:33:07,890 --> 00:33:13,190
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言い訳の仕方とか
Ways to slack off, ways to lean on others, ways to run away, ways to make excuses...

436
00:33:13,690 --> 00:33:16,490
やっと覚えて来た 身につけて来た
I've finally learned them, I've finally acquired them.

437
