もっと覚えたことが 山のようにある
There are still mountains of things I want to learn.

442
00:33:39,990 --> 00:33:41,430
のびしろしかないわ
I've got so much room to grow!

443
00:33:41,430 --> 00:33:47,390
のびしろしかないわ
I've got so much room to grow!

