00:34:47,450 --> 00:34:52,950
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言い訳の仕方とか
Ways to slack off, ways to lean on others, ways to run away, ways to make excuses...

461
00:34:53,370 --> 00:34:56,310
やっと覚えて来た 身につけて来た
I've finally learned them, I've finally acquired them.

462
00:34:56,690 --> 00:34:58,810
柔らかい頭
A soft and flexible mind.

463
00:34:59,110 --> 00:35:00,070
カッコの
