469
00:35:21,018 --> 00:35:25,538
他人に期待をしないのが 今の俺の強み
Not expecting anything from others is my strength right now

470
00:35:26,278 --> 00:35:29,158
手負いでも進める距離なら
If it's a distance I can advance even while wounded

471
00:35:29,958 --> 00:35:33,358
威張る威張る 身のほど知るほどに
I boast and boast, as I realize my station

472
00:35:33,838 --> 00:35:36,578
胸を張り いつも通り
Puffing out my chest, as always

473
00:35:36,818 --> 00:35:42,098
でも時にしたていぜのび やっと大人げないが出来る歳 小さな枠組み
But sometimes showing off, at an age where I can finally afford to be un-adult-like, in a small framework

474
00:35:43,198 --> 00:35:45,458
ただの数字 縛られずに
Just numbers, without being bound

475
00:35:46,178 --> 00:35:49,638
でも腹くくり あの日の俺が立ち止まる
Yet resolving myself, the me of that day stops in my tracks

476
00:35:50,158 --> 00:35:53,758
ほどにでかくそびえ立つ 隅田川にかかる
Towering massively, spanning the Sumida River

477
00:35:55,078 --> 00:35:57,538
勝鬨橋を渡る
Crossing Kachidoki Bridge

478
00:36:02,438 --> 00:36:04,078
重なるスカイツリー 東京タワーと真ん中の頼りない背中
The overlapping Skytree, Tokyo Tower, and the unreliable back in the middle

479
00:36:04,398 --> 00:36:14,658
サボり方とか 甘え方とか 逃げ方とか 言訳の仕方とか やっと覚えてきた 身につけてきた 柔りゃいいやとまあ
How to slack off, how to act spoiled, how to run away, how to make excuses... I've finally learned them, acquired them, thinking soft is fine

480
00:36:15,658 --> 00:36:20,098
カッコのつけ方 調子のこき方 腹の据え方 いい年のこき方
How to look cool, how to get carried away, how to steel your nerve, how to get carried away at a good age

481
00:36:21,198 --> 00:36:24,558
脂乗りに乗った 似合っ得た飯食った
Riding high on success, eating well-deserved meals

482
00:36:24,918 --> 00:36:32,598
だらしない体だ 嫌われ方や 慕われ方や 叱り方とか 綺麗なぶつかり方
Having such a sloppy body. How to be disliked, how to be adored, how to scold, how to clash gracefully

483
00:36:33,438 --> 00:36:35,918
覚えたことが山の様にある
There are mountains of things I've learned

484
00:36:36,258 --> 00:36:49,078
のびしろしかないわ ワンワンワンわ のびしろしかないわ... 俺まだのびしろしかないわ
There's nothing but room to grow, woof woof woof woof, there's nothing but room to grow... I still have nothing but room to grow!

485
00:36:54,118 --> 00:36:55,618
ばかまじめ
[Title: Bakamajime]

486
00:36:56,518 --> 00:36:59,158
くだらない話と
Worthless conversations

487
00:36:59,298 --> 00:37:01,498
うざったい貴様と
And annoying you

488
00:37:01,498 --> 00:37:04,338
なみなみの日々に 注がれてく
Pouring into these brimming days

489
00:37:04,338 --> 00:37:07,238
怠いが溢れ出していく
Sluggishness overflows

490
00:37:07,238 --> 00:37:09,238
飯がまだ届かない
Food still hasn't arrived

491
00:37:09,238 --> 00:37:11,898
仕事は片付かない
Work isn't finished

492
00:37:11,898 --> 00:37:16,938
うだつの上がらない 毎日にため息ばかり
Sighing every day with nothing to show for it

493
00:37:16,938 --> 00:37:19,578
でまた派手にすっころび
Then falling flat on my face spectacularly again

494
00:37:19,578 --> 00:37:22,618
洗い立てのシャツにこぼすコーヒー
Spilling coffee on a freshly washed shirt

495
00:37:22,618 --> 00:37:26,698
前のめりの姿勢だけは褒めて良し 肩を落とし並木通り増えた柄と差し色に
Only the forward-leaning posture is praise-worthy. Dropping my shoulders on the tree-lined avenue, with increased patterns and accent colors

496
00:37:26,978 --> 00:37:29,918
嗚呼… 本当嫌んなる毎日だ
Ah... what a truly miserable everyday life

497
00:37:29,918 --> 00:37:34,398
やりたくないことやったって 嫌々早起きしたって
Even if I do things I don't want to do, even if I wake up early reluctantly

498
00:37:34,398 --> 00:37:40,118
その分素敵な何かが 訪れるとかそんなわけでもないのにさ
It's not like something wonderful will visit me for that reason, yet

499
00:37:40,118 --> 00:37:44,858
今日もまた頑張っちゃうような がむしゃら以外知らないから
I only know how to recklessly push forward, so I'll do my best again today

500
00:37:44,858 --> 00:37:50,278
不器用で 意地っ張りで 馬鹿真面目な僕らに幸あれ
Blessings to us clumsy, stubborn, and foolishly earnest folks

501
00:37:52,378 --> 00:37:55,818
重くなってきた荷物をちょっと置いて立ち止まり
Putting down my heavy luggage for a moment to stop

502
00:37:55,818 --> 00:37:58,698
昨日の事なんざ忘れちまいば同じ
If I forget about yesterday, it's all the same

503
00:37:58,698 --> 00:38:03,498
浴びるdaylight 羽根伸ばし それか月夜にこっそり吐き出してしまえば良い
Bathe in daylight, spread your wings, or quietly spit it out in the moonlight

504
00:38:03,498 --> 00:38:09,118
でもその前にアレとコレの話 その為にはまずはそれを片付け 今は何時?
But before that, let's talk about this and that. To do that, first let's clear that up. What time is it now?

505
00:38:09,118 --> 00:38:13,798
いやその前に 今日もなんだかんだ騒ましい毎度あり
No, before that, today is rowdy as usual, thank you very much

506
00:38:14,098 --> 00:38:17,798
1ヶ月くらい何にも 考えずだらだらしていたいな
I'd like to loaf around without thinking about anything for about a month

507
00:38:17,798 --> 00:38:22,298
ゆっくり休んで遊んで眠っていたいなって思う日もあるけれど
